    "shape_compare": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "checklist": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"at-checklist\"><div class=\"at-checklist__intro\"><p class=\"at-checklist__eyebrow\">01 / Compare the shape</p><h2 id=\"compare-the-shape\" class=\"at-checklist__title\">Classic, relaxed or boxy</h2></div><ol class=\"at-checklist__items\"><li><strong>Classic: BELLA+CANVAS 3001</strong><p>20 &times; 29 at M, 24 &times; 31 at XL. Retail fit, side seamed. The same width as a Gildan 5000.</p></li><li><strong>Relaxed: BELLA+CANVAS 4610</strong><p>21&#8542; &times; 28&frac12; at M, 25&#8542; &times; 30&frac34; at XL. 1&#8542;&quot; wider and &frac12;&quot; shorter than the 3001 at M, with a drop shoulder.</p></li><li><strong>Boxy: Shaka Wear SHMHO</strong><p>24 &times; 28&frac12; at M, 28 &times; 32&frac12; at XL. 4&quot; wider than the 3001 at M; the maker calls it oversized. 8 oz cotton in S&ndash;2XL and 4 colors. <a href=\"/products/shaka-wear-shmho-unisex-max-heavyweight-oversized-t-shirt\">See the SHMHO</a></p></li><li><strong>Pick the shape first</strong><p>Then choose a palette you can carry into the layer, so the tee and the hoodie or crew match.</p></li></ol><p class=\"at-checklist__note\"><strong>How these are measured:</strong> flat chest (1&quot; below the armhole) &times; back body length, in inches, from SanMar and S&amp;S size charts. Allow about 1&quot;. Also in this section: Comfort Colors 1717 is 20&frac14; &times; 28 at M and 24 &times; 30&frac34; at XL; BELLA+CANVAS 1010 is a women&rsquo;s fitted cut, 15 &times; 19&#8541; at M and 17 &times; 21&#8539; at XL (bust).</p></div>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
